{"annotationScore": 5.0, "comments": [{"commentType": "FUNCTION", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "23487775", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Involved in complement regulation. The dimerized forms have avidity for tissue-bound complement fragments and efficiently compete with the physiological complement inhibitor CFH. Can associate with lipoproteins and may play a role in lipid metabolism"}]}, {"commentType": "SUBUNIT", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "23487775", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "Head-to-tail homodimer and heterodimer with CFHR2 or CFHR5"}]}, {"commentType": "SUBUNIT", "texts": [{"evidences": [{"evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269", "id": "23204165", "source": "PubMed"}], "value": "(Microbial infection) Interacts with C.albicans GPD2; the interaction is direct and leads to the degradation of C3"}]}, {"commentType": "INTERACTION", "interactions": [{"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-3935840", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q03591"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "ADGRE2", "intActId": "EBI-11277970", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q9UHX3"}, "numberOfExperiments": 5, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-3935840", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q03591"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "C5", "intActId": "EBI-8558308", "uniProtKBAccession": "P01031"}, "numberOfExperiments": 3, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-3935840", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q03591"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "CFHR1", "intActId": "EBI-3935840", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q03591"}, "numberOfExperiments": 6, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-3935840", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q03591"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "CFHR2", "intActId": "EBI-21976709", "uniProtKBAccession": "P36980"}, "numberOfExperiments": 5, "organismDiffer": false}, {"interactantOne": {"intActId": "EBI-3935840", "uniProtKBAccession": "Q03591"}, "interactantTwo": {"geneName": "CFHR5", "intActId": "EBI-115793